From eeddeef6f5a6d57fb99c762f704c60a9de835951 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:44:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] imx95: frdm: apply configured FIT boot settings

Keep MMC environment loading and board setup enabled. Apply the configured
boot command and load address after loading the saved environment so old
values do not select the AHAB OS-container path. Other saved settings stay
unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [layer boot policy]
Signed-off-by: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
---
 board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c b/board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c
index 16d55bf..68f3343 100644
--- a/board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c
+++ b/board/nxp/imx95_frdm/imx95_frdm.c
@@ -489,6 +489,10 @@ int board_late_init(void)
 	env_set("sec_boot", "yes");
 #endif
 
+	/* Apply the configured FIT boot settings after loading the environment */
+	env_set("bootcmd", CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND);
+	env_set_hex("loadaddr", CONFIG_SYS_LOAD_ADDR);
+
 #ifdef CONFIG_ANDROID_SUPPORT
 	setup_eth_mac_if_empty(0, "ethaddr");
 	setup_eth_mac_if_empty(1, "eth1addr");
-- 
2.53.0

